        "created_at": "2019-04-30T04:24:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>WELCOME TO WHO'S TURN IS IT ANYWAY!&nbsp; WHERE THE PLAN'S MADE UP AND THE HP DOESN'T MATTER!</p>\n<p>Ultimate Akash vs. Argent Adept, America's Greatest Legacy, Freedom Six Tachyon, La Comodora, and the Scholar.</p>\n<p>Very easy mint here.&nbsp; Akash don't really blow up until long after you're setup.&nbsp; The biggest thing is that you have to get SOMEONE ready to damage.&nbsp; Legacy, Tachyon, and Scholar are all valid options, just make sure you pick someone and pick early.&nbsp; (I went with the scholar.)&nbsp; Really the challenge is figuring out the fastest way to take out Akash as you powerbounce!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
