        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Super easy mint, with everyone within 1-2 hp of full, except for Tachyon because I kept out Pushing the Limits longer than I really needed to. Even she was around 20 though.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSoooooooooo much card draw. Everyone had pretty much their entire deck in hand by the end, which suited me fine. Always had exactly what I needed, although I didn't really need all that much. Played Don't Dismiss Anything 5-6 times through La Comodora's power, could have done the same with Takedown if I wanted to lock it down even more. Decided to go with Tachyon as my damage dealer, and she worked pretty well.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne \"Cheeky Bastard!\" play I found in this one shot: If Tachyon has an empty deck but full of Burst card and Lightspeed Barrage trash, and La Comodora has 3 copies of Harnessed Anomaly in hand, Tachyon can play another 3 Lightspeed Barrages on the same turn :) Comodora puts Barrage in Tachyon's empty deck, \"shuffles\", then plays the top card, then Comodora chooses to play another Anomaly to repeat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n~Komori</p>",
