        "created_at": "2019-05-01T08:57:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint, but it took a while. I accidentally drew when Tacyhon’s deck was empty before playing my Light Speed barrages, which slowed things down, but the sheer card draw and out of action stuff meant that it was under control while I plodded towards victory.</p>",
