        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e274bd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-01T11:35:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I never encountered Rockslide or any destruction cards, because I used Comodora to loop Legacy's Takedown.</p>\n<p>Her base power to stack it, plus two timeless treasures to draw it, then tether on AA to have Legacy play it. It locks down not only Akash's regular plays but also her bonus plays from the environment.</p>",
