        "name": "The Grim Digger",
        "username": "The_Grim_Digger",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/3e96dc/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-05-02T00:09:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Easy if slow mint; I used La Commodora to recycle Hypersonic Assault and AA/Legacy to activate Tachyon's card draw, so past a certain point I basically stopped taking damage.&nbsp; AA, Legacy, and Scholar all wound up with their entire deck in play or hand.</p>",
