        "cooked": "<p>Loved this one, this is just about my perfect A-team (OP team?).</p>\n<p>I did over 160 damage in a round, which I'm pretty sure is a personal best by a considerable margin :)&nbsp; (something like 5 lightspeeds, 6 grace under fire -&gt; MFtE, and a Know When to Turn Loose for 30 to finish up - lost count tbh).</p>\n<p>Fun times :)</p>",
